<title>UK: Caspian names head of Indonesia investment banking.</title>
<headline>Caspian names head of Indonesia investment banking.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caspian Securities said on Wednesday it had appointed Sean Hughes to set up and develop its investment banking business in Indonesia.</p>
<p>He previously worked with Jardine Fleming, including heading its Indonesia joint venture securities firm in Jakarta between 1991-94.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
